=== Prompt ===
Who is SpongeBob SquarePants?

=== Response ===
SpongeBob SquarePants is a fictional character and the titular protagonist of the American animated television series of the same name. Created by marine science educator and animator Stephen Hillenburg, the character first appeared on television Nicholaselodeon on May 1, 1999.

SpongeBob SquarePants is a sea sponge who lives in a pineapple under the sea in the underwater city of Bikini Bottom. He works as a fry cook at the fast-food restaurant, the Krusty Krab. SpongeBob is known for his optimistic and energetic personality, and is best friends with a snail named Gary and a starfish named Patrick Star. The show is set in an underwater world populated by anthropomorphic sea creatures, and is known for its humor, surrealism, and imaginative storytelling.

